

**10.4. Airy Functions**

**Definitions and Elementary Properties**

**Differential Equation**

**10.4.1**

\(w^{\prime\prime}\!-\!zw\!=\!0\)

**Pairs of linearly independent solutions are**

**Ai (\(z\)), Bi (\(z\)),**

**Ai (\(z\)), Ai (\(ze^{z\pi t/3}\)),**

**Ai (\(z\)), Ai (\(ze^{-2\pi t/3}\)).**

**Ascending Series**

**10.4.2**

**Ai (\(z\))=\(c_{1}f(z)\!-\!c_{2}g(z)\)**

**10.4.3**

**Bi (\(z\))=\(\sqrt{3}\left[c_{1}f(z)\!+\!eg(z)\right]\)**

\(f(z)\)=1+\(\frac{1}{3!}\)\(z^{3}\!+\!\frac{1\cdot 4}{6!}\)\(z^{6}\!+\!\frac{1\cdot 4\cdot 7}{9!}\)\(z^{9}\!+\!\ldots\)

\(=\!\!\sum\limits_{0}^{\infty}\)\(3^{k}\left(\frac{1}{3}\right)_{k}\frac{z^{2k}}{(3\bar{k})!}\)

\(g(z)\)=\(z\!+\!\frac{2}{4!}\)\(z^{4}\!+\!\frac{2\cdot 5}{7!}\)\(z^{7}\!+\!\frac{2\cdot 5\cdot 8}{10!}\)\(z^{10}\!+\!\ldots\)

\(=\!\!\sum\limits_{0}^{\infty}\)\(3^{k}\left(\frac{2}{3}\right)_{k}\frac{z^{3k+1}}{(3k\!+\!1)!}\)

\(\left(\alpha\!+\!\frac{1}{3}\right)_{k}\!=\!1\)

\(3^{k}\left(\alpha\!+\!\frac{1}{3}\right)_{k}\!=\!(3\alpha\!+\!1)\left(3\alpha \!+\!4\right)\)\(\ldots\)\((3\alpha\!+\!3k\!-\!2)\)

\(\left(\alpha\!\mbox{ arbitrary};\,\,k\!=\!1,2,3,\,\ldots\,\right)\)

**(See 6.1.22.)**

**10.4.4**

\(c_{1}\!=\!\mbox{Ai (0)}\!=\!\mbox{Bi (0)}/\!\sqrt{3}\!=\!3^{-1/3}\!/\Gamma(2/3)\)

\(=\!.35502\)\(80538\)\(87817\)

**10.4.5**

\(c_{2}\!=\!-\!\mbox{Ai}^{\prime}\) (0)\(\!=\!\mbox{Bi}^{\prime}\) (0)/\(\!\sqrt{3}\!=\!3^{-1/3}\!/\Gamma(1/3)\)

\(=\!.25881\)\(94037\)\(92807\)

**Relations Between Solutions**

**10.4.6**

**Bi (\(z\))=\(e^{\pi t/8}\) Ai (\(ze^{2\pi t/8}\))+\(e^{-\pi t/8}\) Ai (\(ze^{-2\pi t/8}\))

**10.4.7**

**Ai (\(z\))+\(e^{\pi t/8}\) Ai (\(ze^{2\pi t/8}\))+\(e^{-2\pi t/8}\) Ai (\(ze^{-2\pi t/8}\))=0**

**10.4.8**

**Bi (\(z\))+\(e^{2\pi t/8}\) Bi (\(ze^{2\pi t/8}\))+\(e^{-2\pi t/8}\) Bi (\(ze^{-2\pi t/8}\))=0**

**10.4.9**

**Ai (\(ze^{\pm\pi t/8}\))=\(\frac{1}{2}\)\(e^{\pm\pi t/8}\)[Ai (\(z\))\(\mp\)\(i\) Bi (\(z\))]**

